# Personal data that was NOT ignored. Audited 2026-09-17: `git status` listed
# data/contacts.tsv as untracked-but-stageable, so a `git add .` would have
# committed 682 real people (names, titles, emails, phone numbers, LinkedIn
# URLs). Every sibling PII file above was already ignored; these were missed.
# The repo is configured to look public (CODEOWNERS, FUNDING.yml, issue
# templates, plugin registry), which is exactly where this would hurt.
data/contacts.tsv
data/job-tracking.xlsx
data/job-tracking-LOCKED.xlsx
data/seen-jobs.tsv
data/linkedin-feed.tsv
data/board-feed.tsv
data/board-queue.tsv
data/build-queue.tsv
data/extracted.tsv
data/gated.tsv
data/websearch-feed.tsv
